                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/releases/tag/v3.26.0"&gt;3.26.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;Summary&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Various bug fixes and optimizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Changes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Tracer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update build and testing to use .NET 10 preview 7 (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3195607915" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7170" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7170/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7170"&gt;#7170&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;add logging for data pipeline status in &lt;code&gt;TracerSettings&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3351007438" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7436" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7436/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7436"&gt;#7436&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use P/Invoke to call  &lt;code&gt;lstat&lt;/code&gt; instead of shelling out to &lt;code&gt;stat&lt;/code&gt; to retrieve the inode (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3366996987" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7453" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7453/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7453"&gt;#7453&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Native] Convert Rejitters vector to a fixed array (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3376231825" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7460" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7460/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7460"&gt;#7460&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Phase 1] chore(configuration): enable &lt;code&gt;DataPipelineEnabled&lt;/code&gt; on the AAS Site Extension (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3382727606" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7464" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7464/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7464"&gt;#7464&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;ASM&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[AAP] Add Forwarded header as IP source (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3354702865" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7438" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7438/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7438"&gt;#7438&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[AAP] Add "100.65.0.0/10" as a private IP range (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3379379916" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7461" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7461/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7461"&gt;#7461&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[IAST] Fix GRPC IAST tests (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3392998419" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7485" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7485/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7485"&gt;#7485&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[IAST] Delay dataflow creation (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3357098266" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7440" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7440/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7440"&gt;#7440&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3366241912" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7451" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7451/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7451"&gt;#7451&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3382777135" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7465" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7465/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7465"&gt;#7465&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Continuous Profiler&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Profiler] Make sure we generate a build-id using SHA-1 (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3365751971" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7449" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7449/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7449"&gt;#7449&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Profiler] Try fixing TSAN job (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3366820118" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7452" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7452/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7452"&gt;#7452&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Serverless&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Azure Functions] Restore files moved by in-process Azure Functions SDK (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3335857335" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7419" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7419/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7419"&gt;#7419&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support &lt;code&gt;final="true"&lt;/code&gt; in NLog Logging rules for direct log submission (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3363238380" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7445" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7445/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7445"&gt;#7445&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extract the Managed DevOps pools names to variables (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3363811794" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7447" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7447/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7447"&gt;#7447&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update language used in native log messages (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3383277222" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7467" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7467/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7467"&gt;#7467&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove &lt;code&gt;Samples.TraceAnnotations.VersionMismatch.NewerNuget&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3383436312" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7469" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7469/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7469"&gt;#7469&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove &lt;code&gt;Samples.CIVisibilityVersionMismatch&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3383761880" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7471" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7471/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7471"&gt;#7471&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add parameter names to MongoDb &lt;code&gt;IBsonSerializerProxy.Serialize()&lt;/code&gt; method (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3359916678" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7443" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7443/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7443"&gt;#7443&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix GRPC instrumentation for BuildHttpErrorResponse. Enable integration tests. (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3375234113" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7457" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7457/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7457"&gt;#7457&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Build / Test&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use mock agent in exploration tests (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3345504234" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7431" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7431/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7431"&gt;#7431&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Test Package Versions Bump] Updating package versions (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3348961653" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7435" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7435/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7435"&gt;#7435&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use the global.json file to specify the .NET SDK version in GitHub Actions (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3358868740" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7442" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7442/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7442"&gt;#7442&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update Managed DevOps pools images (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3363756048" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7446" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7446/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7446"&gt;#7446&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove smoke test image that won't work (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3365887501" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7450" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7450/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7450"&gt;#7450&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Test Package Versions Bump] Updating package versions (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3369624948" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7455" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7455/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7455"&gt;#7455&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bump the gh-actions-packages group across 2 directories with 2 updates (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3374417527" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7456" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7456/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7456"&gt;#7456&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Test Package Versions Bump] Updating package versions (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3376089889" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7458" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7458/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7458"&gt;#7458&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Split dependabot files into separate projects (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3376148636" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7459" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7459/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7459"&gt;#7459&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bump actions/setup-dotnet from 4.3.1 to 5.0.0 in the gh-actions-packages group across 1 directory (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3382118566" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7463" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7463/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7463"&gt;#7463&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Try to fix dependabot (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3383024086" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7466" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7466/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7466"&gt;#7466&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve logging for &lt;code&gt;InstrumentationTests&lt;/code&gt; and update dynamic code scenario (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3383944608" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7472" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7472/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7472"&gt;#7472&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix typo in dependabot yaml (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3387212306" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7477" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7477/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7477"&gt;#7477&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix dependabot again (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3387343476" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7478" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7478/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7478"&gt;#7478&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Miscellaneous&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consolidate bailout checks into native loader (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3379934998" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7462" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7462/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7462"&gt;#7462&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Native] Safer rejitter iterations (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3384168924" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7473" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7473/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7473"&gt;#7473&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
